    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "c386870e8c15b6352a22": "Ah... a customer! Talk to my greatest invention, the Vendor-Tron 1000. He has all your needs... some of the rarest items you will ever find on the market anywhere in Kalimdor... not to mention that his programming will not allow any bargaining, so the price you see is the price you pay."
      },
      "name": "Cork Gizelton",
